<div class="wk-container">
  <div class="wk-header">
    <h1>// welcome()</h1>
    <h2>Welcome to Wokku<%= ", #{@user.name.split.first}" if @user.name.present? %>.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="wk-body">
    <p>Thanks for signing up. You're on a <strong>7-day free trial</strong> — full plan features, no payment method needed yet.</p>

    <div class="wk-label">// three_things_to_try()</div>
    <ul class="wk-list">
      <li>
        <strong>Deploy a template.</strong> One-click deploys for n8n, Ghost, NextCloud, WordPress, and 50+ more.<br>
        <a href="<%= dashboard_templates_url %>">Browse templates →</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Or push your own code.</strong> Create an app, add it as a git remote, <code>git push wokku main</code>.<br>
        <a href="<%= dashboard_apps_url %>">Create your first app →</a>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <hr class="wk-divider">

    <p>Need help? Reply to this email or check the <a href="<%= docs_url %>">docs</a>.</p>
    <p>— Johannes, building Wokku</p>
  </div>
  <div class="wk-footer">
    Wokku · Invoice-based billing · jakarta, id
  </div>
</div>
